    "detailed_description": "In this heart-pumping snowboarding game, you'll experience the rush of carving through the snow at breakneck speeds, all from a thrilling birds-eye view. But beware, this isn't your average leisurely ride down the mountain - you'll need to navigate treacherous terrain, dodge obstacles, and avoid deadly avalanches in order to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you make your way down the mountain, you'll encounter a variety of challenges that will test your skill and reflexes. Jump over cliffs, weave through trees, and grind along rails as you try to stay one step ahead of the danger.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith realistic physics and stunning graphics, this game offers an immersive snowboarding experience that will leave you breathless. Do you have what it takes to make it down the mountain in one piece? Play now and find out.",
